  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the PlayerContext**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `PlayerContext.tsx` file. The goal is to build a robust audio engine management system. I\'m considering how to integrate the audio engine, manage the music library state (tracks, playlists, liked tracks), as well as queue and playback controls (play/pause, seek, volume, shuffle, repeat). Another key part is figuring out how to handle `yt-dlp` stream extraction.\n\n\n**Refining Context Functionality**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the specific functions within `PlayerContext`. I\'m meticulously outlining the structure: handling the music library data (`LibraryData`), a `fetchLibrary()` function for loading data. I\'m building out individual functions, like `playTrack()` to manage stream retrieval and API calls for history updates. Also, I\'m thinking about integrating playback controls such as play/pause, volume and seeking functions, as well as functions to handle shuffling and repeating tracks.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
