    modified_response: "I have completed the personal **YouTube Music Clone** web application built with a full-stack Node.js Express backend and React TypeScript Tailwind CSS frontend.\n\n### Architecture & Key Features Implemented:\n\n- **Single-User Security (`minecraftprahas@gmail.com`)**:\n  - Implemented strict email authentication in `server.ts` restricting access to `minecraftprahas@gmail.com`.\n  - Blocks unauthorized users and provides Google OAuth and 1-click single-user verification with session cookies.\n\n- **No-Database JSON Persistence (`data/playlists.json`)**:\n  - Managed directly via Node.js `fs` file operations in `server/db.ts`.\n  - Tracks saved songs, custom user playlists, liked songs, and recently played track histories.\n\n- **`yt-dlp` Backend Audio Stream Extraction**:\n  - Executable wrapper in `server/ytdlp.ts` using client spoofing flags (`--extractor-args \"youtube:player_client=android,web\"`) to prevent bot blocks.\n  - Dynamically fetches direct audio stream URLs, resolves track metadata (title, artist, thumbnail, duration), and provides live YouTube search results.\n\n- **YouTube Music Dark UI & Sticky Audio Player**:\n  - **Sidebar & Header**: YouTube Music branding, navigation (Home, Explore & Search, Library, Liked Songs, Custom Playlists), and quick YouTube link import.\n  - **Sticky Bottom Player Bar**: Complete HTML5 audio player with track artwork, title, artist, like button, shuffle, previous, play/pause, next, repeat modes, interactive seek bar, volume control, and queue drawer.\n  - **Queue Drawer & Fullscreen Visualizer**: Up Next queue slide-over drawer and fullscreen audio wave modal.\n  - **Explore & Search View**: Search YouTube live via `yt-dlp` and save tracks directly into `data/playlists.json`."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
